From d54782de8942852784eeeb663b0734430e2903cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 23:01:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: separate late CPU expected planning input

Use the field-valid prior-cycle target contract only for pure
cache and HWCAP planning. Keep current target observations empty,
omit HWCAPs whose expected register is unavailable, and leave mixed
GIC, hyp, SMCCC, and modern-ID decisions unresolved.

Publish no READY token and request no CPU.
---
 arch/arm64/include/asm/late_cpu_profile.h |   6 +
 arch/arm64/kernel/cpu_errata.c            |  50 +++++++
 arch/arm64/kernel/cpufeature.c            | 164 ++++++++++------------
 arch/arm64/kernel/late_cpu_profile.c      |   6 +-
 arch/arm64/kernel/mt6797_psci.c           |   6 +
 5 files changed, 136 insertions(+), 96 deletions(-)

